hadiths[40]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Kusikia habari si kama kujionea mwenyewe"
"2","[AI-translation] Vita ni hila"
"3","[AI-translation] Muislamu ni kioo cha Muislamu mwenzake"
"4","[AI-translation] Mtu anayeombwa ushauri ni mwenye kuaminiwa"
"5","[AI-translation] Anayeongoza kwenye kheri ni kama anayeifanya"
"6","[AI-translation] Jisaidieni katika mahitaji yenu kwa kuyaficha"
"7","[AI-translation] Jikingeni na Moto hata kwa (kutoa sadaka ya) nusu ya tende"
"8","[AI-translation] Dunia ni gereza la Muumini na pepo ya kafiri"
"9","[AI-translation] Staha ni kheri yote"
"10","[AI-translation] Ahadi ya Muumini ni kama kushika kwa kiganja (lazima itimizwe)"
"11","[AI-translation] Haifai kwa Muumini kumtenga ndugu yake zaidi ya siku tatu"
"12","[AI-translation] Si miongoni mwetu yule anayetughoshi"
"13","[AI-translation] Kidogo kinachotosheleza ni bora kuliko kingi kinachoghafilisha"
"14","[AI-translation] Anayerudi katika zawadi yake ni kama anayerudi katika matapishi yake"
"15","[AI-translation] Balaa huambatana na matamshi"
"16","[AI-translation] Watu ni kama meno ya kitana"
"17","[AI-translation] Utajiri ni utajiri wa nafsi"
"18","[AI-translation] Mwenye furaha ni yule anayewaonywa kwa (yaliyowapata) wengine"
"19","[AI-translation] Na hakika baadhi ya mashairi ni hekima, na hakika baadhi ya ubainifu ni sihiri"
"20","[AI-translation] Msamaha wa wafalme ni kubakiza ufalme"
"21","[AI-translation] Mtu atakuwa pamoja na yule aliyempenda"
"22","[AI-translation] Hakuangamia mtu aliyejua kipimo chake"
"23","[AI-translation] Mtoto ni wa (mwenye) kitanda, na kwa mzinifu ni jiwe"
"24","[AI-translation] Mkono wa juu ni bora kuliko mkono wa chini"
"25","[AI-translation] Hamshukuru Mwenyezi Mungu yule asiyewashukuru watu"
"26","[AI-translation] Kupenda kwako kitu kunakupofusha na kukuziba masikio"
"27","[AI-translation] Nyoyo zimeumbwa kumpenda yule aliyezifanyia wema na kumchukia yule aliyezifanyia ubaya"
"28","[AI-translation] Mwenye kutubia dhambi ni kama asiye na dhambi"
"29","[AI-translation] Shahidi anaona asichokiona aliye mbali"
"30","[AI-translation] Mtukufu wa watu akijieni, basi mheshimuni"
"31","[AI-translation] Kiapo cha uongo huacha nyumba zikiwa magofu"
"32","[AI-translation] Yule aliyeuawa kwa ajili ya (kuilinda) mali yake, basi yeye ni shahidi"
"33","[AI-translation] Matendo ni kwa nia"
"34","[AI-translation] Bwana wa watu ni mtumishi wao"
"35","[AI-translation] Bora ya mambo ni yaliyo ya wastani"
"36","[AI-translation] Ee Mwenyezi Mungu, ubariki umma wangu katika kuamka kwake mapema, siku ya Alhamisi"
"37","[AI-translation] Umaskini umekaribia kuwa ukafiri"
"38","[AI-translation] Safari ni kipande cha adhabu"
"39","[AI-translation] Bora ya masurufu ni uchamungu"
"40","[AI-translation] Vikao ni amana"
